    <data name="FeaturesEyebrow" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Why Fernhouse</value>
    </data>
    <data name="FeaturesTitle" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Everything a plant needs, before it needs it</value>
    </data>
    <data name="FeaturesLede" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>The app knows your plants, your windows and your week. It does the remembering, so you can do the enjoying.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature1Title" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Matched to your light</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature1Body" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Tell us which way your windows face, and the shop shows the plants that will thrive there first.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature2Title" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Reminders that adapt</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature2Body" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Watering, feeding and repotting reminders that shift with the season and the weather where you live.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature3Title" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Delivery to the hour</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature3Body" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>A two-hour window the day before and live tracking on the day. Plants travel upright, in compostable packaging.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature4Title" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>A 30-day guarantee</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature4Body" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>If a plant struggles in its first month, send a photo from the app. We replace it, and nobody asks who forgot to water it.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature5Title" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Pots that fit</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature5Body" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Every plant lists the pots it fits, so you never come home with a beautiful pot that's two centimetres too small.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature6Title" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>A plant doctor</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Feature6Body" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Yellow leaves? Take a photo, and a plant specialist answers in the app within a working day.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="CareEyebrow" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Plant care</value>
    </data>
    <data name="CareTitle" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>A care plan for this week, not for a plant in a book</value>
    </data>
    <data name="CareBody" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Fernhouse builds each plant's plan from its species, its pot and the room it lives in. When a heatwave comes, the plan changes before your plant notices.</value>
    </data>
