        <value>From people who used to lose even cacti</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Review1Quote" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>The reminders actually adapt. My calathea survived its first Dutch winter, which is more than I can say for the last three.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Review1Name" xml:space="preserve">
