    <data name="Faq1Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Where do you deliver?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq1Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Next day across the Netherlands and Belgium, and within three days to Germany, France and Luxembourg.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq2Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Which plants are safe for cats and dogs?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq2Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Every plant page says whether it's pet-safe, and the app can hide the ones that aren't. Calatheas, spider plants and Boston ferns are popular safe choices.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq3Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>How does the 30-day guarantee work?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq3Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>If a plant struggles in its first 30 days, send a photo from the order page. We send a replacement, or a refund if you prefer.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq4Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Do I need the app to order?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq4Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>No, you can order on the web too. The app adds care reminders, the plant doctor and the first-order discount.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq5Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>How do I use the code FERN15?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq5Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Install the app, add plants to your bag and enter FERN15 at checkout. It takes 15% off your first order.</value>
    </data>
